        {
          "id": "start-info",
          "kind": "html",
          "title": "About this template",
          "x": 764,
          "y": 64,
          "width": 492,
          "height": 640,
          "sourceId": "main",
          "showHeader": false,
          "transparentBackground": true,
          "noBorder": true,
          "background": "transparent",
          "borderColor": "#d5dce8",
          "borderThickness": 0,
          "filters": [],
          "htmlData": {
            "sourceIds": [],
            "maxRows": 0,
            "useFilteredContext": true,
            "bindings": []
          },
          "htmlDocument": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\n:root{--ink:#1d2939;--muted:#5d6b82;--grid:#d5dce8;--soft:#eef2fa}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font:13px/1.5 Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif}\nmain{display:grid;gap:12px;padding:2px}section{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--grid);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px}h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px}\nul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 7px}.note{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px}\n</style></head><body><main>\n<section><h2>How the template works</h2><p style=\"margin:0\">The <b>Gantt plan</b>, the <b>Kanban board</b> and the <b>Report</b> use the same tasks. Change a task in one place and it updates everywhere. Use the buttons at the top of each page to move between them.</p></section>\n<section><h2>What you can change</h2><ul>\n<li><b>Statuses</b> – Gantt settings › Status. The Kanban columns follow them.</li>\n<li><b>Colors</b> – owners, projects and statuses have colors in the Gantt settings. The Kanban board uses them (List designer › Colors from the Gantt).</li>\n<li><b>Card fields</b> – List designer › Board › Fields on cards.</li>\n<li><b>Report</b> – the measures <i>Tasks</i>, <i>Projects</i> and <i>Open tasks</i> are in Measures on the source <i>Project tasks</i>.</li>\n</ul></section>\n<div class=\"note\">This page is only for getting started. The last step in the guide removes it, or right-click <b>Start here</b> in the page list and choose Delete.</div>\n</main></body></html>"
        },
